           EXEC CICS
              LINK PROGRAM  ('UR1CCLI0')
              COMMAREA      (UGWCCLI0)
              NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC
      *
           IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL) OR
              WCLS-UGCERCLI = CTE-CON-ALFA-99
              MOVE 'ERROR LINK UR1CCLI0'      TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
