      *
           MOVE WS-DATE-DB2                     TO LQS-FECOVALI
           MOVE LQS-PLAZO                       TO WS-CODIGO-PERIODO-4
      *
           EVALUATE WS-CODIGO-4
             WHEN  3
                 MULTIPLY WS-PERIODO-4 BY 12
                    GIVING WS-NUM-PERIODOS
                 IF WS-NUM-PERIODOS > 999
                    MOVE 999                  TO WS-PERIODO-4
                 ELSE
                    MOVE WS-NUM-PERIODOS      TO WS-PERIODO-4
                 END-IF
             WHEN  2
                 CONTINUE
             WHEN  1
                 DIVIDE WS-PERIODO-4 BY 30
                    GIVING WS-NUM-PERIODOS
                 MOVE WS-NUM-PERIODOS         TO WS-PERIODO-4
           END-EVALUATE
