                 MOVE 0                       TO WS-PORC-SUBVEN
              ELSE
                 DIVIDE WS-PRICUOTA BY COT-CUOTA
                     GIVING WS-PORC-SUBVEN
                     ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 225-REBOSAMIENTO
                 END-DIVIDE
              END-IF
           END-IF
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *  AL0051D ENDOWMENT
      ******************************************************************
           IF ADS-TIPODIAS   NOT = CTE-CON-2      AND
              ADS-TIPODIAS   NOT = CTE-CON-4      AND
              ADS-CODTIAMO   NOT = 'T'            AND
              ADS-CODTIAMO   NOT = 'W'
              PERFORM  29412-CALC-PRI-LIQ-AMO
           END-IF
      *
           IF (ADS-CODTIAMO        = 'T'        OR
               ADS-CODTIAMO        = 'W' )      AND
