              MOVE BCD-FEVENCIN               TO WS-FECHA-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *    SE INICIALIZAN LAS FECHAS Y LOS CONTADORES
      ******************************************************************
           IF WS-FECHA-LIQ > IEN-FEFIVALI
              MOVE CTE-CON-UGE0327           TO CAA-COD-ERROR
              PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-IF
      *
           PERFORM 29413-INIC-CONTADORES
      *
           IF ADS-CODTIAMO = 'B'
              MOVE MAE-IMPDISPU               TO WS-CAPITAL-INICIAL
           END-IF.
