           EJECT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *             29412-CALC-PRI-LIQ-A                              *
      *                                                                *
      *    SE CALCULA LA FECHA DE PRIMERA LIQUIDACION PARA PRESTAMOS   *
      *    CON TIPO DE CUOTA 'A' Y LIQUIDACIONES.                      *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       29412-CALC-PRI-LIQ-A.
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHA-DISP                 TO WS-DATE-SALIDA
           MOVE MAE-UGCDIPAG                  TO WS-DIA-PAGO
           MOVE WS-DIA-PAGO                   TO DFP-DIA
           PERFORM  888888-FORMT-FECHA-DB2
           MOVE WS-DATE-DB2                   TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
           MOVE CTE-CON-1                     TO DFP-NUM-PERIODOS
           MOVE ADS-TIPODIAS                  TO DFP-TIPODIAS
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-INICIAL             TO WS-FECHA-LIQ-ANT
                                                 WS-FECHA-AMO-ANT
                                                 WS-FECHA-1
                                                 WS-FECHA-2
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHA-LIQ-ANT              TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
      *
           IF  WS-PERIODICIDAD = SPACES
               MOVE  ADS-PERCAP               TO DFP-PERCAP
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-PERIODICIDAD           TO DFP-PERCAP
           END-IF
      *    CUANDO CODTIAMO = 'A'
           IF  ADS-CODTIAMO     = CTE-CON-A
               MOVE  ADS-PERINT               TO DFP-PERCAP
           END-IF
      *
           PERFORM  666666-LLAMAR-RUTINA
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO WS-FECHA-LIQ.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *             2223-MENOR-CUOTA                                   *
      *                                                                *
      *    SE HALLA LA PRIMERA NUEVA CUOTA DEL PRESTAMO                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       2223-MENOR-CUOTA.
      *
           INITIALIZE                         COT-NIVEL-01
      *
           MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO WS-PER-CAPITAL
      *
           IF ADS-CODTIAMO = CTE-CON-B
              COMPUTE COT-CAPITAL-INICIAL ROUNDED =
                      MAE-UGIIIANA
              END-COMPUTE
           END-IF
      *@COL04-I
           IF  WS-INT-CAPITALIZABLES NOT EQUAL TO SPACES
           AND MAE-FEULIQ < MAE-FECPRILIQ
               MOVE MAE-FEPROLIQ                  TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
               MOVE MAE-UGCDIPAG                  TO WS-DIA-PAGO
               MOVE WS-DIA-PAGO                   TO DFP-DIA
               MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO DFP-PERCAP
               MOVE -1                            TO DFP-NUM-PERIODOS
               MOVE '1'                           TO DFP-TIPODIAS
      *
               PERFORM   666666-LLAMAR-RUTINA
      *
               MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO WS-FECAUX
           END-IF
           IF  MAE-FECPRILIQ = MAE-FEPROLIQ
           AND WS-FECAUX     > CAA-FECHA-CONT2
           AND WS-INT-CAPITALIZABLES = '1'
               COMPUTE WS-TASA-MNSUAL = WS-INTERES-NOMINAL / 100 / 12
      *@COL05-I
               IF MAE-SITPRES = '0'
      *@COL05-F
                 COMPUTE WS-INT-GRA = (WS-TASA-MNSUAL * MAE-SALTEOR) *
                                       WS-PRDO-GRCIA
      *@COL05-I
               ELSE
                   IF MAE-SITPRES = '8'
                      COMPUTE WS-INT-GRA = (WS-TASA-MNSUAL
                                        * MAE-IMPCONCE) * WS-PRDO-GRCIA
                   END-IF
               END-IF
               IF MAE-SITPRES = '0'
      *@COL05-F
                  COMPUTE MAE-SALTEOR = MAE-SALTEOR + WS-INT-GRA
      *@COL05-I
               ELSE
                  IF  MAE-SITPRES = '8'
                     COMPUTE MAE-IMPCONCE = MAE-IMPCONCE + WS-INT-GRA
                  END-IF
               END-IF
      *@COL05-F
               MOVE WS-FECAUX                     TO MAE-FEULIQ
           END-IF
           IF  MAE-FECPRILIQ = MAE-FEPROLIQ
           AND WS-INT-CAPITALIZABLES = '0'
               MOVE WS-FECAUX                     TO MAE-FEULIQ
           END-IF
      *@COL04-F
      *
      *@COL05-I
           IF MAE-SITPRES = '0'
      *@COL05-F
              COMPUTE COT-CAPITAL    ROUNDED =  MAE-SALTEOR
              END-COMPUTE
      *@COL05-I
           ELSE
              IF MAE-SITPRES = '8'
                 COMPUTE COT-CAPITAL    ROUNDED = MAE-IMPCONCE
              END-IF
           END-IF

      *@COL05-F
      *
           MOVE COT-CAPITAL                   TO WS-C-INICIAL
      *
           IF ADS-UGYFARET   =  'C'
      *VER20000929-I-INCI-CAVE
      ******************************************************************
      *  EN COLOMBIA SIEMPRE SE VA A CONCEDER EL MISMO IMPORTE SOLICI- *
      *  TADO, POR LO CUAL NO SE RETIENE NADA                          *
      ******************************************************************
      *       COMPUTE WS-RETENIDO    ROUNDED =
      *               MAE-IMPCONCE           - MAE-IMPDISPU
      *       END-COMPUTE
      *
      *       COMPUTE WS-C-INICIAL   ROUNDED =
      *               WS-C-INICIAL           + WS-RETENIDO
      *       END-COMPUTE
      *
      *       IF ADS-CODTIAMO = 'B'
      *          COMPUTE COT-CAPITAL-INICIAL ROUNDED =
      *                  COT-CAPITAL-INICIAL         + WS-RETENIDO
      *          END-COMPUTE
      *       END-IF
      *
              MOVE ZERO                    TO WS-RETENIDO
      *
      *VER20000929-F-INCI-CAVE
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-C-INICIAL                  TO COT-CAPITAL.
      *
           PERFORM 22231-CALC-S
      *
           MOVE ZERO                          TO COT-INT-EFECTIVO
           MOVE IEN-NOMINAL                   TO COT-INT-NOMINAL
      *
           EVALUATE ADS-CODTIAMO
             WHEN '1'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN '2'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
             WHEN '3'
               MOVE ADS-PROGGEOM              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN '4'
               MOVE ADS-PROGGEOM              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
             WHEN '5'
               MOVE ADS-PROGGEOM              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22233-CALC-T-R-N
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN '6'
               MOVE ADS-PROGGEOM              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22233-CALC-T-R-N
             WHEN '7'
               MOVE ADS-PROGARIT              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN '8'
               MOVE ADS-PROGARIT              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
             WHEN '9'
               MOVE ADS-PROGARIT              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22233-CALC-T-R-N
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN '0'
               MOVE ADS-PROGARIT              TO COT-RAZON
                                                 CO2-RAZON
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22233-CALC-T-R-N
             WHEN 'A'
               MOVE 1                         TO COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN
             WHEN 'B'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
      ******************************************************************
      *   AMORTIZACION GRADUAL                                         *
      ******************************************************************
             WHEN 'C'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22235-CALC-PLAZO-GRACIA
               MOVE MAE-IMPCONCE              TO COT-CAPITAL
      ******************************************************************
      * CRECIENTE GEOMETRICA                                           *
      ******************************************************************
             WHEN 'D'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               MOVE MAE-PLAZO                 TO COT-PER-VIGENCIA
               MOVE ADS-LININCUO              TO COT-LININCUO
               MOVE MAE-SUBSUJET              TO COT-SUBSUJET
             WHEN 'G'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
      *@COL06-I
             WHEN 'H'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 222233-VALOR-GRADIENTE
      *@COL06-F
             WHEN 'I'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN 'P'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN 'R'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN 'T'
               MOVE 1                         TO COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN
             WHEN 'W'
               MOVE 1                         TO COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN
      *@COL01-I
             WHEN 'K'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
             WHEN 'L'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
               PERFORM 22234-CALC-DPL-AJ
             WHEN 'M'
               PERFORM 22232-CALC-M
      *@COL01-F
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           MOVE COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN             TO WS-M-INICIAL
           MOVE COT-AMO-RESTAN-PER            TO WS-R-INICIAL
      *
           PERFORM 22235-RESTO-DATOS-1.
      *@COL02-I
           IF MAE-FEFORMA NOT = '0001-01-01'
              MOVE 'N'                        TO COT-CALCULAR-A
              MOVE MAE-FECPRILIQ              TO COT-F-FORMA
           ELSE
              MOVE 'S'                        TO COT-CALCULAR-A
