           ELSE
              IF MAE-SITPRES = CTE-CON-8
                 MOVE MAE-IMPDISPU            TO WS-SALDO-VIVO
                                                 WS-CAPITAL-INICIAL
              ELSE
      *@COL05-I
                 IF MAE-SITPRES = '0'
      *@COL05-F
                    MOVE MAE-SALTEOR             TO WS-SALDO-VIVO
      *@COL05-I
                 ELSE
                     IF MAE-SITPRES = '8'
