           MOVE MAE-FEPROAMO                  TO CUO-FECOVALI
           MOVE COT-CUOTA                     TO CUO-IMPMINI
           MOVE MAE-FEVENCIN                  TO WS-FIN-VALIDEZ-CUOTA
           MOVE CUO-IMPMINI                   TO WS-PRICUOTA.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *             2942-CALCULO-PRELIM-OTROS                          *
