       244-CALCULO-PERIODO.
      *
           PERFORM 2441-CONSULTAR-AMA
      *
           IF AMA-LIBRE-FEC1 > '0001-01-01'
              MOVE AMA-LIBRE-FEC1           TO WS-DATA-INI
           ELSE
              MOVE MAE-FEFORMA              TO WS-DATA-INI
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE ZERO                       TO WS-NUM-PERI
           PERFORM 0000-RUTINA-UR8CDFP0
                 UNTIL WS-DATA-INI(1:8) =  MAE-FECPRILIQ(1:8)
           MOVE WS-NUM-PERI                TO WS-PRDO-GRCIA
           COMPUTE WS-PRDO-GRCIA = WS-PRDO-GRCIA - 1.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                  0000-RUTINA-UR8CDFP0.                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     CRIDA AL RUTINA UR8CDFO0 PER SUMA  WS-PERCAP               *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-RUTINA-UR8CDFP0.
      *
           INITIALIZE                         URECRES URECDF3
      *
      *@COL07-I
           IF MAE-UGCDIPAG = ZEROS
      *       MOVE MAE-FEFORMA(9:2)           TO DF3-DIA
              MOVE WS-DATA-INI(9:2)           TO DF3-DIA
           ELSE
              MOVE MAE-UGCDIPAG               TO DF3-DIA
           END-IF
      *@COL07-F
      *
           MOVE WS-DATA-INI                   TO DF3-FECHA-INICIAL
           MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO DF3-PERCAP
           MOVE  1                            TO DF3-NUM-PERIODOS
           MOVE '1'                           TO DF3-TIPODIAS
      *
      *    CALL   'UR8CDFP0'   USING  URECRES
           CALL   BBVA-UR8CDFP0
